                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "If you like matching games and don't mind thinking just a little, this game is for you. The only exception is on level 35. It is impossible to get 3 stars. Calculations for pts needed and level of items to clear is too high. Other then that, the time in between lives should be reduced down to 10 min per life and not 30 min per life. Good game.\n\nOh - developers might want to rethink poping time mode after level is finished. If I have 20 moves left and there is one pop per move, then it does no good to have them pop all at the same time unless we get 10X the points for numbers cleared. One pop please per clear - this way we collect pts for each move we didn't have to use during game play.",
